<title>UK: LIFFE cocoa and sugar lower, coffee mixed AM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE cocoa and sugar lower, coffee mixed AM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - Barely traded and prices drift lower after steadier start. Sept off 10 stg at 1,028 at 0950 GMT on a volume of 222.</p>
<p>COFFEE - Tightly mixed but still rangebound. Sept up $3 at $1,780.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Down in subdued trade after weaker CSCE close. Aug down $1.10 at $318.00.</p>
</text>
